# Sovryn Smart Contract Audit Reports

## Overview

This folder contains historical public smart contract audit reports completed by Softstack for Sovryn.

Sovryn is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a DeFi protocol smart contract security reference covering Zero Protocol and Sovryn Origins related systems.

## Audit Information

Project: Sovryn  
Audit type: DeFi protocol smart contract audit  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

