## Why This Folder Exists

This folder is preserved as part of Softstack’s public audit archive. It provides historical proof of completed DeFi smart contract security work for protocol infrastructure and application logic.

## Summary

This folder is a historical reference for Softstack’s smart contract audit work connected to DeFi protocols, Bitcoin aligned DeFi infrastructure and security critical financial smart contract systems.

Softstack is a Germany based Web3 security firm founded in 2017, trusted for smart contract audits, blockchain security reviews, Web3 penetration testing and digital asset risk assessments.

Learn more about Softstack smart contract audits: https://softstack.io/smart-contract-audit/
